{"id":"torrey:mercy-seat","source":"torrey","name":"Mercy Seat","slug":"mercy-seat","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Moses commanded to make — Ex 25:17.","refs":[["Exod",25,17,25,17]]},{"text":"Bezaleel given wisdom to make — Ex 31:2,3,7.","refs":[["Exod",31,2,31,2],["Exod",31,3,31,3],["Exod",31,7,31,7]]},{"text":"Made of pure gold — Ex 25:17; 37:6.","refs":[["Exod",25,17,25,17],["Exod",37,6,37,6]]},{"text":"The cherubim formed out of, and at each end of it — Ex 25:18-20; Heb 9:5.","refs":[["Exod",25,18,25,20],["Heb",9,5,9,5]]},{"text":"Placed upon the ark of testimony — Ex 25:21; 26:34; 40:20.","refs":[["Exod",25,21,25,21],["Exod",26,34,26,34],["Exod",40,20,40,20]]},{"text":"Appeared over in the cloud. — Le 16:2.","refs":[["Lev",16,2,16,2]]},{"text":"Dwelt over. — Ps 80:1.","refs":[["Ps",80,1,80,1]]},{"text":"Spoke from above. — Ex 25:22; Nu 7:89.","refs":[["Exod",25,22,25,22],["Num",7,89,7,89]]},{"text":"Covered with a cloud of incense on the day of atonement — Le 16:13.","refs":[["Lev",16,13,16,13]]},{"text":"The blood of sacrifices on the day of atonement sprinkled upon and before — Le 16:14,15.","refs":[["Lev",16,14,16,14],["Lev",16,15,16,15]]},{"text":"Christ. — Ro 3:25; Heb 9:3.","refs":[["Rom",3,25,3,25],["Heb",9,3,9,3]]},{"text":"The throne of grace. — Heb 4:16.","refs":[["Heb",4,16,4,16]]}],"refCount":21}
